        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our objectives are (i) to attract, develop and retain a highly qualified workforce with backgrounds and experience in multiple areas whose skills and strengths are consistent with CFC’s mission, and (ii) to create an engaged and collaborative work culture, which we believe is critical to deliver exceptional service to our members.",
        "start_character": 41367,
        "end_character": 41699
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000070502-25-000211",
